---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { rel, SUPPORT_EMAIL, LEGAL_NAME } from '../../consts';
const description = 'Privacy policies for Dudley Development apps.';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description={description} path="/privacy/">
  <main class="page">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:720px;">
      <a class="back" href={rel('/')}>← Home</a>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Effective date: September 29, 2026 · One policy per app — pick yours below.</p>

      <p>
        {LEGAL_NAME} makes several separate apps, and they don't all collect the same things, so there
        isn't one policy that's accurate for all of them. Read the policy for the app you actually use —
        the table below is a quick summary, and each app's own page has the full detail. A few things are
        true everywhere: we never sell your personal data, we don't share data across our own apps to
        build a profile of you, none of our apps are directed at children, and any usage analytics we run
        ourselves is anonymous and disclosed on the app's page below. Some free apps show ads through
        Google AdMob, which is disclosed per app, including whether the ad requests are personalized and
        whether Apple's tracking permission is involved.
      </p>

      <h2>Quick comparison</h2>
      <div class="table-scroll" style="overflow-x:auto; margin:1rem 0;">
        <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:0.92rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="text-align:left; padding:6px 10px 6px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #333);">App</th>
              <th style="text-align:left; padding:6px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #333);">Crash reports</th>
              <th style="text-align:left; padding:6px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #333);">Usage analytics</th>
              <th style="text-align:left; padding:6px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #333);">Ads</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Powell Prowl: Rate Chase</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, with an ATT prompt (personalized unless you decline)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">VibeRater Social</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Yes (Sentry)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Yes (PostHog, pseudonymous; off in Private mode)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, non-personalized, no ATT prompt</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Table Talk: Conversation Cards</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">If you allow tracking or turn it on (Sentry)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">If you allow tracking or turn it on (PostHog)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, with an ATT prompt (personalized only if you allow; no ads in EEA/UK/CH)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">EconByte: Daily Economics</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">If you allow tracking or turn it on (Sentry)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">If you allow tracking or turn it on (PostHog)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, with an ATT prompt (personalized only if you allow; no ads in EEA/UK/CH)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Last Human: Dodge the Bots</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Yes (Sentry)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Yes (PostHog, on by default, opt-out in Settings)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, with an ATT prompt from v1.0.1 (personalized only if you allow; no ads in EEA/UK/CH), plus an optional rewarded ad to continue a run</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Beat the Dealer: Card Counting</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Yes when configured (Sentry)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Opt-in only (PostHog, off until Enable Optional Analytics)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, non-personalized, no ATT prompt; no ads in EEA/UK/CH</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Packed Yet? Trip Checklist</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, non-personalized, no ATT prompt; no ads in EEA/UK/CH or unknown regions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">ActionCard: Next Steps</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">Google AdMob, non-personalized, no ATT prompt; no ads in EEA/UK/CH or unknown regions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0;">ReplyGate: Reply or Skip</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px;">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px;">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px;">Google AdMob, non-personalized, no ATT prompt; no ads in EEA/UK/CH or unknown regions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">ClaimDesk</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No (claims sync only if you sign in to use an AI assistant)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No ads</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">TaxShelf</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No (the shelf syncs only if you turn on AI assistants)</td>
              <td style="padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #222);">No ads</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <ul class="policy-list">
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/monetary-policy-independence-day/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/powell-prowl-iconpng')} alt="Powell Prowl: Rate Chase app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>Powell Prowl: Rate Chase</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/vibe-rater/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/vibe-rater-iconpng')} alt="VibeRater Social app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>VibeRater Social</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/table-talk/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/table-talk-iconpng')} alt="Table Talk app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>Table Talk: Conversation Cards</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/econbyte/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/econbyte-iconpng')} alt="EconByte app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>EconByte: Daily Economics</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/last-human/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/last-human-iconpng')} alt="Last Human app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>Last Human: Dodge the Bots</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/beat-the-dealer/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/beat-the-dealer-iconpng')} alt="Beat the Dealer: Card Counting app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>Beat the Dealer: Card Counting</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/packed-yet/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/packed-yet-icon.svg')} alt="Packed Yet? Trip Checklist app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>Packed Yet? Trip Checklist</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/claimdesk/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/claimdesk-iconpng')} alt="ClaimDesk app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>ClaimDesk</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/taxshelf/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/taxshelf-iconpng')} alt="TaxShelf app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>TaxShelf</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/action-card/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/action-card-icon.svg')} alt="ActionCard app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>ActionCard: Next Steps</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="row" href={rel('/privacy/reply-gate/')}>
            <img src={rel('/assets/reply-gate-icon.svg')} alt="ReplyGate app icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="meta"><b>ReplyGate: Reply or Skip</b><span>Privacy policy</span></span>
            <span class="chev">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="pattern-gym-waitlist">Pattern Gym waitlist (waitlist.dudleyapps.com)</h2>
      <p>
        Pattern Gym is a chart-reading practice app we have not released yet. Its waitlist at
        <a href="https://waitlist.dudleyapps.com/">waitlist.dudleyapps.com</a> is a web page, separate from every app above, and this section is its
        whole policy. {LEGAL_NAME} is the controller; contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>What we keep:</b> the email address you type; a short source tag from the link you
          arrived by (for example <code>x</code> when the link came from our X account); when you
          signed up and when you confirmed; and which version of the consent sentence you ticked.
          We do not keep your IP address, device or browser details, and the page sets no cookies of
          its own.</li>
        <li><b>Why, and the legal basis:</b> your consent (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a)), given with the checkbox
          on the form. We use the address for exactly two emails: one to confirm it, and one when
          Pattern Gym is on the App Store. It is never added to a newsletter, used for another Dudley
          app, sold or shared for anyone's marketing.</li>
        <li><b>Spam check:</b> the form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to check that a person, not a bot,
          filled it in. Turnstile processes your IP address and browser signals for that check. Our
          server passes your IP address to Turnstile for the check and does not store it.</li>
        <li><b>Who processes it for us:</b> Cloudflare, Inc. hosts the page and its database
          (Workers and D1), runs Turnstile, and sends the two emails (Cloudflare Email Sending). Data
          may be processed in the United States; Cloudflare's data processing addendum, including the
          EU Standard Contractual Clauses, covers the transfer.</li>
        <li><b>How long we keep it:</b>
          <ul>
            <li>If you never confirm: deleted 7 days after the confirmation email.</li>
            <li>If you confirm: deleted 7 days after we send the launch email.</li>
            <li>If we decide not to release Pattern Gym: every address is deleted within 30 days of
              that decision, and we will not email you.</li>
            <li>In any case: deleted no later than 12 months after you signed up.</li>
            <li>If you click "Remove my email" in either email, the address is deleted straight
              away.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><b>Counts we keep:</b> the number of confirmed signups per day and per source tag. These
          counts contain no email address and are kept after the addresses are deleted, so we can
          judge how much interest there was.</li>
        <li><b>Your rights:</b> you can withdraw consent and delete your address at any time with the
          link in either email, or by writing to <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.
          You can also ask for a copy of what we hold or have it corrected. If you are in the EEA,
          the UK or Switzerland, you can complain to your data protection authority.</li>
        <li><b>Age:</b> the waitlist is not meant for anyone under 16.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What's true across every Dudley app</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>{LEGAL_NAME} is the developer of every app listed here. We are not a data broker and we do not sell personal data.</li>
        <li>None of our apps use your data from one Dudley app to target or personalize another.</li>
        <li>None of our apps are directed at children, and none knowingly collect data from anyone under 13 (VibeRater requires users to be at least 16).</li>
        <li>Where an app runs its own crash reporting or usage analytics, it is disclosed on that app's page, uses a random per-install or per-account identifier rather than your name or contact details, and is never used to serve ads.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about any app, or a data request? Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
